<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-10 mx-auto">
      <div class="card shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-5">
          <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
          <p class="lead mb-5">Find answers to the most common questions about Rapira.</p>

          <!-- General Questions -->
          <div class="mb-5">
            <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">General Questions</h2>

            <div class="accordion" id="accordionGeneral">
              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
                  <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                    What is Rapira?
                  </button>
                </h3>
                <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p class="text-dark">Rapira is the ultimate platform for Indian rap artists and fans to connect, discover, and experience the best of hip-hop culture. We provide a space for artists to showcase their talent, organize concerts, and share content with their fans.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                    How do I create an account?
                  </button>
                </h3>
                <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p class="text-dark">Creating an account on Rapira is simple:</p>
                    <ol class="text-dark">
                      <li>Click on the "Sign Up" button in the top right corner of the homepage</li>
                      <li>Enter your email address, name, and create a password</li>
                      <li>Verify your email address by clicking the link sent to your inbox</li>
                      <li>Complete your profile information</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p class="text-dark">Once registered, you can browse concerts, follow artists, and purchase tickets.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                    Is Rapira available on mobile devices?
                  </button>
                </h3>
                <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree" data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p class="text-dark">Yes, Rapira is fully responsive and works on all mobile devices. You can access all features through your mobile browser. We're also working on dedicated mobile apps for iOS and Android, which will be available soon.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Artist Questions -->
          <div class="mb-5">
            <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">For Artists</h2>

            <div class="accordion" id="accordionArtists">
              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                    How do I become an artist on Rapira?
                  </button>
                </h3>
                <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#accordionArtists">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p class="text-dark">To become an artist on Rapira:</p>
                    <ol class="text-dark">
                      <li>Create a regular user account and log in</li>
                      <li>Go to your profile and click on "Become an Artist"</li>
                      <li>Fill out the artist application form with your details, including your stage name, genre, and social media links</li>
                      <li>Submit your application for review</li>
                      <li>Our team will review your application and approve it if it meets our criteria</li>
                      <li>Once approved, you'll gain access to the Artist Dashboard</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p class="text-dark">You can try out the artist features in our <a href="/demo/artist">Artist Demo</a> before applying.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
                    How do I create and manage concerts?
                  </button>
                </h3>
                <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#accordionArtists">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p class="text-dark">As an approved artist, you can create and manage concerts through your Artist Dashboard:</p>
                    <ol class="text-dark">
                      <li>Log in to your artist account</li>
                      <li>Navigate to the "Concerts" section in your dashboard</li>
                      <li>Click "Create Concert" and fill in details like title, venue, date, time, and ticket price</li>
                      <li>Upload a concert poster image</li>
                      <li>Submit your concert for approval</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p class="text-dark">Once approved, your concert will be visible to fans on the platform. You can manage ticket sales, view attendee information, and update concert details from your dashboard.</p>
                    <p class="text-dark">Try our <a href="/demo/concert">Concert Demo</a> to see how it works.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingSix">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSix" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSix">
                    How do I share my music and videos?
                  </button>
                </h3>
                <div id="collapseSix" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSix" data-bs-parent="#accordionArtists">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p class="text-dark">Sharing your content on Rapira is easy:</p>
                    <ol class="text-dark">
                      <li>Log in to your artist account</li>
                      <li>Go to the "Content" section in your dashboard</li>
                      <li>Click "Add Content" and choose the type (song, video, etc.)</li>
                      <li>Add YouTube links for your audio or video content</li>
                      <li>Add a title, description, and thumbnail</li>
                      <li>Submit for approval</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p class="text-dark">Once approved, your content will appear on your artist profile for fans to enjoy. Check out our <a href="/demo/content">Content Demo</a> to see the process in action.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Fan Questions -->
          <div class="mb-5">
            <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">For Fans</h2>

            <div class="accordion" id="accordionFans">
              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingSeven">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSeven" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSeven">
                    How do I purchase tickets for concerts?
                  </button>
                </h3>
                <div id="collapseSeven" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSeven" data-bs-parent="#accordionFans">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p class="text-dark">Purchasing tickets on Rapira is a simple process:</p>
                    <ol class="text-dark">
                      <li>Browse upcoming concerts on the Concerts page</li>
                      <li>Click on a concert to view details</li>
                      <li>Select the number of tickets you want to purchase</li>
                      <li>Complete the checkout process with our secure payment system</li>
                      <li>Receive your tickets via email and in your account dashboard</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p class="text-dark">You can try our <a href="/demo/ticket">Ticket Purchase Demo</a> to see how it works.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingEight">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseEight" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseEight">
                    What are the benefits of subscribing to Rapira?
                  </button>
                </h3>
                <div id="collapseEight" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingEight" data-bs-parent="#accordionFans">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p class="text-dark">Subscribing to Rapira offers several benefits:</p>
                    <ul class="text-dark">
                      <li>Discounts on concert tickets (5-20% depending on your plan)</li>
                      <li>Early access to ticket sales before they're available to the general public</li>
                      <li>Access to exclusive content from your favorite artists</li>
                      <li>Ad-free experience on the platform</li>
                      <li>Priority customer support</li>
                      <li>Exclusive merchandise opportunities</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="text-dark">We offer different subscription plans to fit your needs. Check out our <a href="/demo/subscription">Subscription Demo</a> to learn more.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="accordion-item">
                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingNine">
                  <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseNine" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseNine">
                    How do I get a refund for a ticket?
                  </button>
                </h3>
                <div id="collapseNine" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingNine" data-bs-parent="#accordionFans">
                  <div class="accordion-body">
                    <p class="text-dark">If you need a refund for a ticket purchase:</p>
                    <ol class="text-dark">
                      <li>Log in to your account</li>
                      <li>Go to "My Tickets" in your dashboard</li>
                      <li>Select the ticket you want to refund</li>
                      <li>Click "Request Refund" and provide a reason</li>
                      <li>Submit your request</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p class="text-dark">Refund eligibility depends on the concert's refund policy and how close it is to the event date. Please refer to our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a> for complete details.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Contact Section -->
          <div class="mt-5 text-center">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold mb-3">Still have questions?</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">If you couldn't find the answer to your question, please contact our support team.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary px-4 py-2">Contact Us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
